<title>ESTONIA: HANSA FUND NETTED 8.55 MLN KROONS IN Q1.</title>
<headline>HANSA FUND NETTED 8.55 MLN KROONS IN Q1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Privatization Investment Fund returned a net profit of 8.55 million kroons in the first quarter, it said on Friday.</p>
<p>The fund's net profit for the whole year in 1996 was 8.2 million kroons, the fund added in its statement.</p>
<p>Its assets were at 46.5 million kroons in the first quarter, compared to 26.4 million kroons at the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>Hansa Privatization Investment Fund is listed on Tallinn stock exchange fund list.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6308 400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
